<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 6,767 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 3,000 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  169   (166 and 149)</p>
<p>    Good		162   (152 and 135)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     152   (144 and 122)</p>
<p>    Medium	    146   (137 and 105)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	100   (105 and  80)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 169 pence for a Kenya PF.1</p>
</text>
